,"included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"resolved_identity_cases":[{"id":"u-shiji109-liaoxi","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-109-liguang:p006","c-shiji-108-han:p012"],"note":"兩篇遼西太守被殺、鴈門遭入及安國屯漁陽敘事相近，但本篇此事在右北平任官之前、卷108繫於李廣被俘敘事之明年；年代與事件對讀尚未完成，保留兩名未名候選，不補姓名或同指。 此案曾列未決；本批按已保存的逐項同指證據整併至唯一人物 ID，來源名稱、引文與暫定狀態保留。","person_id":"tpa_vui_ddb","identity_equivalence_decision_ids":["eq-shiji109-context-liaoxi-prefect","eq-shiji110-tpa_vui_ddb","eq-shiji111-tpa_vui_ddb"],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-shiji109-liaoxi","person_id":"tpa_vui_ddb","event_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p006","quote":"匈奴入殺遼西太守","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0099"}],"interpretation_note":"保存原文明示被殺事件，日期未知，不據此推定其他官爵終點。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false},{"id":"le-shiji110-liaoxi","person_id":"tpa_vui_ddb","event_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":"其明年秋","normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":128,"year":-127,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"自馬邑軍後五年之秋，漢使四將軍各萬騎擊胡關市下。將軍衛青出上谷，至蘢城，得胡首虜七百人。公孫賀出雲中，無所得。公孫敖出代郡，爲胡所敗七千餘人。李廣出鴈門，爲胡所敗，而匈奴生得廣，廣後得亡歸。漢囚敖、廣，敖、廣贖爲庶人。其冬，匈奴數入盜邊，漁陽尤甚。漢使將軍韓安國屯漁陽備胡。其明年秋，匈奴二萬騎入漢，殺遼西太守，略二千餘人。胡又入敗漁陽太守軍千餘人，圍漢將軍安國，安國時千餘騎亦且盡，會燕救至，匈奴乃去。匈奴又入鴈門，殺略千餘人。於是漢使將軍衛青將三萬騎出鴈門，李息出代郡，擊胡。得首虜數千人。其明年，衛青復出雲中以西至隴西，擊胡之樓煩、白羊王於河南，得胡首虜數千，牛羊百餘萬。於是漢遂取河南地，築朔方，復繕故秦時蒙恬所爲塞，因河爲固。漢亦棄上谷之什辟縣造陽地以予胡。是歳，漢之元朔二年也。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p031","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m031-0151","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/110.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《資治通鑑》卷十八平行事件","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷018&oldid=1511465","quote":"秋，匈奴二萬騎入漢，殺遼西太守","scope":"received_parallel_event","image_verified":false},{"title":"《資治通鑑》卷十八數位編輯紀年標題","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷018&oldid=1511465","quote":"元朔元年（癸丑，公元前一二八年）","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"其明年秋承首場前129年，換前128年、天文年-127；與通鑑遼西太守被殺、圍韓安國及衛青李息出塞同事件相合。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false},"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p031","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m031-0151","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/110.json"}],"interpretation_note":"保存明示死亡及相對日期原句，僅記事件年；不以死亡終止所有官爵，不補精確月日或死亡地。於單數月承本段受封，通鑑同年另記數月卒。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false},{"id":"le-shiji111-p005-tpa_vui_ddb","person_id":"tpa_vui_ddb","event_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":"明年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","source_id":"s-shiji111-wei-huo","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p005","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m005-0052","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/111.json"}],"normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":128,"year":-127,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"元朔元年春，衛夫人有男，立為皇后。其秋，青為車騎將軍，出雁門，三萬騎擊匈奴，斬首虜數千人。明年，匈奴入殺遼西太守，虜略漁陽二千餘人，敗韓將軍軍。漢令將軍李息擊之，出代；令車騎將軍青出雲中以西至高闕。遂略河南地，至于隴西，捕首虜數千，畜數十萬，走白羊、樓煩王。遂以河南地為朔方郡。以三千八百戶封青為長平侯。青校尉蘇建有功，以千一百戶封建為平陵侯。使建筑朔方城。青校尉張次公有功，封為岸頭侯。天子曰：「匈奴逆天理，亂人倫，暴長虐老，以盜竊為務，行詐諸蠻夷，造謀藉兵，數為邊害，故興師遣將，以征厥罪。詩不云乎：『薄伐玁狁，至于太原』，『出車彭彭，城彼朔方』。今車騎將軍青度西河至高闕，獲首虜二千三百級，車輜畜產畢收為鹵，已封為列侯，遂西定河南地，按榆谿舊塞，絕梓領，梁北河，討蒲泥，破符離，斬輕銳之卒，捕伏聽者三千七十一級，執訊獲醜，驅馬牛羊百有餘萬，全甲兵而還，益封青三千戶。」其明年，匈奴入殺代郡太守友，入略鴈門千餘人。其明年，匈奴大入代、定襄、上郡，殺略漢數千人。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","source_id":"s-shiji111-wei-huo","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p005","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m005-0052","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/111.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《資治通鑑》同役","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷018&oldid=1511465","quote":"秋，匈奴二萬騎入漢，殺遼西太守，略二千餘人，圍韓安國壁","scope":"received_parallel_event","image_verified":false},{"title":"《資治通鑑》數位編輯紀年標題","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷018&oldid=1511465","quote":"元朔元年（癸丑，公元前一二八年）","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"basis":{"kind":"parallel_event","source_event_quote":"明年，匈奴入殺遼西太守","reference_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷018&oldid=1511465","reference_event_quote":"秋，匈奴二萬騎入漢，殺遼西太守，略二千餘人，圍韓安國壁","reference_year_quote":"元朔元年（癸丑，公元前一二八年）"},"rationale":"通鑑元朔元年及匈奴列傳同役置前128年。本文接元朔元年其秋後明年，若直算為前127年；編輯暫依同役取128，原敘事承接不改。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false},"interpretation_note":"明記入殺，不由官署推死亡地點；本文明年與平行役紀年分歧保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m012-0059","start":59,"end":63,"surface":"遼西太守","kind":"person","person_id":"tpa_vui_ddb","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-108-han:p012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m006-0099","start":99,"end":103,"surface":"遼西太守","kind":"person","person_id":"tpa_vui_ddb","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m031-0151","start":151,"end":155,"surface":"遼西太守","kind":"person","person_id":"tpa_vui_ddb","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p031","chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m005-0052","start":52,"end":56,"surface":"遼西太守","kind":"pers